   "lines": [
    "except at those",
    "bitter ^moments^ when I",
    "realize what I",
    "have lost. Father",
    "was himself so",
    "invariably cheerful",
    "that I feel it",
    "would be wrong",
    "for me to be gloomy,",
    "and besides, fortunately",
    "or unfortunately, I",
    "am of a very",
    "buoyant temper — being",
    "a bit of an optimist.",
    "Had a glorious",
    "20-mile ride on",
    "Lightfoot; canter-",
    "-ing the whole time."
   ],
